lt: leave the env file's secret alone. If you relied on the legacy zero-config zero-auth flow, set `TDPILOT_ENABLE_AUTH_BYPASS=1` in `~/.tdpilot-dpsk4/.tdpilot-dpsk4.env` to opt back in. The legacy `TDPILOT_DISABLE_AUTH_BYPASS=1` opt-out is honored as a no-op for env-file backwards compat. See the v2.5.4 CHANGELOG entry for the full migration matrix.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n[Bug]DeepSeek V4 does not support pipeline parallelism (PP) in PD disaggregation · Issue #25765 · sgl-project/sglang · GitHub (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25765)\nciteturn41128search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5 months ago; Crawled: last week; opened on May 19, 2026 ...     `[2026-05-19 08:25:33] Setting swa_full_tokens_ratio to 0.1 for DeepseekV4ForCausalLM.\n\n# [Bug]DeepSeek V4 does not support pipeline parallelism (PP) in PD disaggregation #25765\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nClosed\n\n#25771\n\nClosed\n\n[Bug]DeepSeek V4 does not support pipeline parallelism (PP) in PD disaggregation#25765\n\n#25771\n\nCopy link\n\n## Description\n\nshiyu7\n\nopened on May 19, 2026\n\n### Describe the bug\n\nIt looks like DeepSeek V4 does not support pipeline parallelism (PP) in Prefill mode after rebase. CC @whybeyoung\nError info:\n    \n    `[2026-05-19 08:25:33] Setting swa_full_tokens_ratio to 0.1 for DeepseekV4ForCausalLM.\n    Traceback (most recent call last):\n      File \"/usr/local/bin/sglang\", line 6, in <module>\n        sys.exit(main())\n                 ^^^^^^\n      File \"/root/sglang/python/sglang/cli/main.py\", line 40, in main\n        serve(args, extra_argv)\n      File \"/root/sglang/python/sglang/cli/serve.py\", line 126, in serve\n        server_args = prepare_server_args(dispatch_argv)\n                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n      File \"/root/sglang/python/sglang/srt/server_args.py\", line 7367, in prepare_server_args\n        return ServerArgs.from_cli_args(