ated! This project ships frequently — new features, bug fixes, and quality improvements land every few days. In Obsidian, go to Settings → Community Plugins → Check for updates regularly to stay current. You can also watch the GitHub repository for release notifications.\n\n### 🤔 What does this plugin actually do?\n\nDrop any note → AI extracts people, concepts, theories → auto-generates interlinked wiki pages with `[[bidirectional links]]`. Then ask \"what did I write about X?\" and get answers grounded in YOUR notes, not internet hallucinations.\n\n* * *\n\n### 🔧 Minimum requirements\n\n  * Obsidian v1.6.6+\n  * Any LLM provider API key (Anthropic, Gemini, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Kimi, GLM, OpenRouter, or custom endpoint)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n[Bug]: 429之后卡死其他所有模型调用 · Issue #4515 · agentscope-ai/QwenPaw · GitHub (https://github.com/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw/issues/4515)\nciteturn41128search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5 months ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; opened on May 19, 2026 ...     [2026-05-19 09:17:06]  INFO  rate_limiter.py:264 ... AI Debug via Deepseek V4 Flash Free on Opencode:\n\n# [Bug]: 429之后卡死其他所有模型调用 #4515\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nNew issue\n\nCopy link\n\nClosed\n\n#4487\n\nClosed\n\n[Bug]: 429之后卡死其他所有模型调用#4515\n\n#4487\n\nCopy link\n\nLabels\n\nbugSomething isn't workingSomething isn't working\n\n## Description\n\nrupyerlua\n\nopened on May 19, 2026\n\nIssue body actions\n\n## QwenPaw Version\n\ndocker v1.1.7\n\n## Description\n\n[Describe the bug clearly and concisely. What happened vs what you expected?]\n\n## Component(s) Affected\n\n  * [Input] Core / Backend (app, agents, config, providers, utils, local_models)\n  * [Input] Console (frontend web UI)\n  * [Input] Channels (DingTalk, Feishu, QQ, Discord, iMessage, etc.)\n  * [Input] Skills\n  * [Input] CLI\n  * [Input] Documentation (website)\n  * [Input] Tests\n  * [Input] CI/CD\n  * [Input] Scripts / Deploy\n\n## Environment\n\n  * QwenPaw